      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْرَزٌ</span></b>  [lit. <i>A place to which one goes forth in
the field,</i> or <i>plain,</i> or <i>open tract or country;</i>]
<i>a privy,</i> or <i>place where one performs ablution;</i>
syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَوَضَّأْ</span>; (S;) [as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَبَرَّزٌ</span></b> , occurring in
